  "notes": "Form 1040 line 34: 'If line 33 is more than line 24, subtract line 24 from line 33. This is the amount you overpaid' (f1040-2025 l.133). Always published: line 33 minus line 24 when larger, else $0 -- the equal-payments case (neither a refund nor an amount owed) is a genuine zero here, not an absence (P0 Sec. 1)."
